{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>&quot;Secrets don\u2019t stay locked away forever.&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While investigating the disappearance of his daughter Sarah, <strong>Mark</strong>, with the help of his friend Sheriff Poul, uncovers clues that lead directly to a mysterious company known as <strong>&quot;The Box&quot;</strong>. Now, behind locked doors, empty hallways, and forgotten documents, something much bigger is waiting to be revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Box of Fear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>first-person psychological horror game</strong> that blends:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Narrative exploration</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Moments of tension</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzles and interconnected clues</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Claustrophobic environments and an unsettling atmosphere</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No weapons. No guarantees. Your only tool will be your <strong>curiosity</strong>, and your ability to <strong>escape</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Would you open the box?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare yourself for a <strong>silent, intimate, and disturbing</strong> journey, where each step may reveal something you\u2019d <strong>rather not have discovered</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3881960?t=1754442176","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3881960?t=1754442176","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881960/233a555499740439c80c5174b803c2144f421163/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754442176","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea